abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a retrospective cohort of 4,635 first conventional IVF cycles,
  developing and internally validating a 10-predictor random forest for low
  fertilization rate or total fertilization failure (2PN fertilization rate < 30%).
  The pipeline covers data preparation, 30 multiple imputations, collinearity
  diagnostics, two-stage model selection across nine algorithms, internal
  validation, SHAP-based interpretation and generation of all manuscript figures
  and tables.
